Tolerances are the smaller |eps| of the two signs. gamma ~ draught ~ h (rho_i known): the same
relative accuracy applies to the measured draught; note beta ~ h^3 for an independent reference.
In absolute terms at p0 (draught gamma H = 2.74 mm): |db/b| <= 1% needs +-0.34 mm (lsm6dsv16x);
d_sys <= 0.5 needs +-0.009 mm. These are p0 values: other floes have other sensitivities (A1).

